Execution and Ongoing Risk Monitoring

This framework cleanly separates alpha generation (analysts + quant signals) from risk management (minimum-volatility optimization). The optimizer does not decide which stocks to like or dislike; it determines the lowest-risk portfolio that best expresses the predefined conviction structure while satisfying practical portfolio constraints.
